# .worktreeinclude - gitignored paths Orca copies into each new local worktree.
# Docs: https://www.onorca.dev/docs/model/orca-yaml
#
# One literal path per line. No globs, no negation. Entries must exist and be
# gitignored in the primary checkout; missing entries are skipped silently.
# Copies are private per worktree - changing a value in the primary checkout
# does not propagate to existing worktrees.
#
# .bruin.yml is committed, so it arrives with checkout and is not listed here.
# database/dwh.duckdb is 8 MB and gitignored: copying it beats rebuilding the
# warehouse by hand in every worktree.

.env
database/dwh.duckdb
